            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#SPS">
                <p>Sacred to Belenus Augustus, this vow was undertaken on behalf of Aulus Aquillius Valens, son of Gaius, part of the tribe Pomptina dedicated quatavir by right of law, the freedman Phoebus willingly and deservedly set up this vow.</p>
